        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>求是苑·剪影 - 在军训中磨砺青春</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = { tex: { inlineMath: [['$', '$']], displayMath: [['$$', '$$']] } };\n</script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  body {\n    font-family: \"SimSun\", \"Songti SC\", serif;\n    background: #f0f0f0;\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 20px 0;\n  }\n  .page {\n    width: 1260px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    background: #fff;\n    padding: 20px 30px;\n    position: relative;\n  }\n  /* Header */\n  .header {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    border-bottom: 4px solid #c0392b;\n    padding-bottom: 10px;\n    margin-bottom: 15px;\n  }\n  .header-left {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 15px;\n  }\n  .page-num {\n    background: #c0392b;\n    color: #fff;\n    font-size: 34px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    width: 42px;\n    height: 42px;\n    text-align: center;\n    line-height: 42px;\n  }\n  .section-title {\n    font-size: 30px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    letter-spacing: 2px;\n  }\n  .header-mid {\n    font-size: 14px;\n    text-align: left;\n    margin-top: 5px;\n    line-height: 1.6;\n  }\n  .header-right {\n    text-align: right;\n  }\n  .logo-cn {\n    font-size: 26px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    color: #c0392b;\n    font-family: \"KaiTi\", serif;\n  }\n  .logo-en {\n    font-size: 12px;\n    letter-spacing: 2px;\n    color: #333;\n  }\n\n  /* Top photo strip */\n  .photo-strip {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    gap: 15px;\n    margin-top: 15px;\n  }\n  .photo-item {\n    flex: 1;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n  .caption-small {\n    font-size: 13px;\n    line-height: 1.4;\n    margin-bottom: 6px;\n  }\n  .placeholder {\n    background: #d9d9d9;\n    border: 1px solid #999;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    color: #555;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    text-align: center;\n    padding: 4px;\n  }\n  .top-photo {\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 150px;\n  }\n\n  /* Headline */\n  .headline-block {\n    text-align: center;\n    margin: 30px 0 10px 0;\n  }\n  .headline {\n    font-size: 46px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    letter-spacing: 4px;\n  }\n  .subheadline {\n    font-size: 17px;\n    margin-top: 8px;\n  }\n\n  /* Main content grid */\n  .main-content {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 18px;\n    margin-top: 20px;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n  }\n  .col-left {\n    width: 34%;\n  }\n  .col-left .big-photo {\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 620px;\n  }\n  .col-left .caption-small {\n    text-align: right;\n    margin-top: 8px;\n  }\n\n  .col-mid {\n    width: 18%;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    gap: 45px;\n  }\n  .col-mid .photo-block {\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n  .col-mid .placeholder {\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 190px;\n  }\n  .col-mid .caption-small {\n    text-align: left;\n    margin-top: 6px;\n  }\n\n  .col-text {\n    width: 30%;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    line-height: 1.9;\n    text-align: justify;\n  }\n  .col-text p {\n    margin: 0 0 10px 0;\n    text-indent: 2em;\n  }\n  .col-text .credit {\n    text-align: right;\n    margin-top: 20px;\n    text-indent: 0;\n  }\n  .qr-row {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 12px;\n    margin-top: 15px;\n  }\n  .qr-row .placeholder {\n    width: 75px;\n    height: 75px;\n    font-size: 10px;\n  }\n  .qr-text {\n    font-size: 13px;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n  }\n\n  .col-right {\n    width: 18%;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    gap: 30px;\n  }\n  .col-right .photo-block {\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n  .col-right .placeholder {\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 200px;\n  }\n  .col-right .caption-small {\n    text-align: left;\n    margin-top: 6px;\n  }\n\n  /* Footer */\n  .footer {\n    border-top: 1px solid #333;\n    margin-top: 30px;\n    padding-top: 8px;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    text-align: center;\n    color: #333;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <!-- Header -->\n  <div class=\"header\">\n    <div class=\"header-left\">\n      <div class=\"page-num\">4</div>\n      <div>\n        <div class=\"section-title\">求是苑&nbsp;·&nbsp;剪影</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"header-mid\">\n      <div>2018年9月14日&nbsp;&nbsp;星期五</div>\n      <div>责任编辑：张岚&nbsp;&nbsp;联系电话：0571-88981339</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"header-right\">\n      <div class=\"logo-cn\">浙江大学报</div>\n      <div class=\"logo-en\">ZHE&nbsp;JIANG&nbsp;DA&nbsp;XUE&nbsp;BAO</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Top photo strip -->\n  <div class=\"photo-strip\">\n    <div class=\"photo-item\">\n      <div class=\"caption-small\">汗水流过坚毅的脸庞<br>陈佳轩&nbsp;摄</div>\n      <div class=\"placeholder top-photo\">[Photo: 士兵侧脸特写]</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"photo-item\">\n      <div class=\"caption-small\">挥旗<br>施良辰&nbsp;摄</div>\n      <div class=\"placeholder top-photo\">[Photo: 学生挥动旗帜]</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"photo-item\">\n      <div class=\"caption-small\">别担心，我不累<br>梁汉卿&nbsp;摄</div>\n      <div class=\"placeholder top-photo\">[Photo: 教官与学生对话]</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"photo-item\">\n      <div class=\"caption-small\">关怀<br>何念泽&nbsp;摄</div>\n      <div class=\"placeholder top-photo\">[Photo: 教官帮学生整理装备]</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Headline -->\n  <div class=\"headline-block\">\n    <div class=\"headline\">在军训中磨砺青春</div>\n    <div class=\"subheadline\">——浙江大学2018年学生军训掠影</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Main content -->\n  <div class=\"main-content\">\n\n    <!-- Left big photo -->\n    <div class=\"col-left\">\n      <div class=\"placeholder big-photo\">[Photo: 长廊中列队学生，中间一人正步走过，两侧地面摆放矿泉水瓶]</div>\n      <div class=\"caption-small\">在校园的每个角落练习着<br>军姿<br>陈佳轩&nbsp;摄</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Middle photo column -->\n    <div class=\"col-mid\">\n      <div class=\"photo-block\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: 合唱比赛场景，学生击鼓]</div>\n        <div class=\"caption-small\">用一场合唱<br>比赛铭记这些闪<br>亮的日子<br>胡琪宣&nbsp;摄</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"photo-block\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: 学生宣誓/递交入党申请书]</div>\n        <div class=\"caption-small\">用一份入党<br>申请书见证理想<br>与信念<br>胡琪宣&nbsp;摄</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"photo-block\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: 拔河比赛]</div>\n        <div class=\"caption-small\">用一场拔河<br>比赛演绎青春的<br>力量<br>陈佳轩&nbsp;摄</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Text column -->\n    <div class=\"col-text\">\n      <p>紫金港，你五点钟的晨曦真美。</p>\n      <p>见过早晨五点钟的校园吗？柔亮的光里忽地划出几声嘹亮的口号，然后映出大团的绿，不同于大自然肆意的绿色，那是一种属于军人的——规矩的绿！军装整齐、步伐一致、口号嘹亮，浙大的新人们迎来了他们军训的一天。</p>\n      <p>谁言书生只善文，军训场上显神威！既怀得鲲鹏之志，岂能无钢铁之躯？壮志凌云，跃跃欲试；意气风发，摩拳擦掌。能文善武，成大国之器；握笔挥刀，铸全能之材！</p>\n      <p>紫金港，你日光下汗浸衣襟的战士们真帅。</p>\n      <p>\"向左转！向右转！\"\"齐步走！\"一遍两遍，百遍千遍。不娇不惧，不悔不怕。浙大人不怕苦，浙大人要磨炼钢铁意志！心中有理想，脚下有力量。目光坚定，我们向往成为钢铁一般的战士，故我们忍耐，我们奋发，至刚至坚，长空亮剑，气贯云天！</p>\n      <p>烈日炎炎，熔不了心中激情；汗水浡浡，带不走崇高信念。青春年华，用汗水诠释；前路漫漫，用血泪征服！</p>\n      <p>宣父犹能畏后生，丈夫未可轻年少！不屈——不屈——！</p>\n      <p>紫金港，你夕阳里的藕舫路真好看。</p>\n      <p>屈原道：\"路漫漫其修远兮，吾将上下而求索。\"竞才校长二问犹然在耳，唯有向前，全力以赴，才可不负重托。前人栽树，兰老同志身前着这方生机盎然的土地，同学长学姐一起，为我们守护着这方生机盎然的土地。战火中的西迁故事，林俊德院士的事迹……既传达了力量，更是我们的榜样！传承的重任在肩，要传承的是一代代浙大人[?]创业的精神，要传承的是一代代浙大人求是创新的灵魂！</p>\n      <p>紫金港，你路灯下的湖水轻轻泛起涟漪，你黑暗中的荷枝柔柔地扭动腰肢，你月牙楼边传来的歌声微微回响。</p>\n      <p>这一天末了，战士们都进入梦乡。</p>\n      <p>紫金港，你今天真好看。我想，明天的你一定更加美丽！</p>\n      <p class=\"credit\">本版文字&nbsp;&nbsp;包蓉&nbsp;&nbsp;杨萝萝</p>\n\n      <div class=\"qr-row\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">[QR Code]</div>\n        <div class=\"qr-text\">用手机QQ<br>扫二维码<br>加入浙江大学<br>QQ智慧校园</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Right photo column -->\n    <div class=\"col-right\">\n      <div class=\"photo-block\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: 定向越野奔跑]</div>\n        <div class=\"caption-small\">在定向越野中奋力奔跑<br>陈佳轩&nbsp;摄</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"photo-block\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: 男生列队站在球场遮挡阳光]</div>\n        <div class=\"caption-small\">一排男生站成一列，用<br>自己的影子给姑娘挡住烈日</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"photo-block\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: 迷彩方阵行进]</div>\n        <div class=\"caption-small\">迷彩的颜色是今夏紫金<br>港最靓丽的风景线<br>陈佳轩&nbsp;摄</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Footer -->\n  <div class=\"footer\">\n    本报通讯地址：浙江大学紫金港校区东三105《浙江大学报》编辑部&nbsp;&nbsp;邮编：310058&nbsp;&nbsp;电子信箱：zdxb@zju.edu.cn&nbsp;&nbsp;电话：0571-88981339&nbsp;88273707&nbsp;&nbsp;总编：应飚&nbsp;&nbsp;副总编：章旻&nbsp;&nbsp;电子编辑：李岑&nbsp;&nbsp;承印：新华通讯社浙江分社印刷厂\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
